\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 1. Leadership Profile Interpretation\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf2 Your profile indicates an 
\f0\b Ethical Strategist
\f1\b0  leadership style. Your highest scores in Humility (82) and Ethical Leadership (79) show a strong foundational drive to prioritize the team, maintain moral integrity, and operate without ego.\
\
Interestingly, your Machiavellianism score (57) sits in the moderate range. Paired with high ethics and humility, this doesn't suggest manipulation, but rather 
\f0\b principled pragmatism
\f1\b0 . You likely understand organizational politics and can navigate them effectively to achieve ethical outcomes. You do not lead with ego (Narcissism 46) and have strong prosocial instincts (Empathy 64).\
\
