\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Workplace Triggers:
\f1\b0  You may feel profound frustration when dealing with highly self-serving, boastful, or unethical peers, as their behavior sharply violates your core values of humility and ethics.\uc0\u8232 \
\ls1\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
