\f0\b\fs36 \cf2 7. A Note on Interpretation\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf2 Self-assessments offer a snapshot of your current self-perception, not a permanent diagnosis. Traits like "Machiavellianism" or "Narcissism" in this context refer to behavioral tendencies on a spectrum, not clinical conditions. Use this data as a mirror for reflection, adapting the insights to best serve the dignity and psychological safety of those you lead.\
